WEBVTT

00:00.040 --> 00:02.040
There are a variety of factors that

00:02.040 --> 00:04.207
contribute to insomnia , including bad

00:04.207 --> 00:06.570
sleep habits , depression , anxiety ,

00:06.600 --> 00:09.250
illness , discomfort or regular work

00:09.250 --> 00:10.917
schedules during deployment .

00:10.917 --> 00:12.840
Fortunately , there are ways to

00:12.840 --> 00:14.780
diagnose and treat insomnia ,

00:14.790 --> 00:16.730
behavioral health consultants can

00:16.730 --> 00:18.897
provide brief behavioral treatment for

00:18.897 --> 00:21.008
insomnia to help you change behaviors

00:21.008 --> 00:22.720
to promote lasting sleep at night .

